      "content": "thanks. some of the board members are worried that this might sound too aggressive to the foundation. they think managed conservation is still necessary for things like preventing wildfires or protecting specific endangered species that might not recover on their own in a rewilding setup. can you add a section that dismisses those concerns as being part of the old way of thinking?",
